dot/pull/107312.patch","merged_at":"2026-04-07T23:25:49Z"},"body":"https://github.com/Dav1dde/glad/releases/tag/v2.0.8\r\n\r\n**Changes from version 2.0.4 to version 2.0.5:**\r\n\r\n- Fix missing Vulkan video headers\r\n- Use FindPython instead of FindPythonInterp\r\n- Add --version option to command-line interface\r\n- Remove one duplicated check for glGetString(GL_VERSION)\r\n- Fix extensions loading and parsing\r\n- Provide CMake package\r\n\r\n**Changes from version 2.0.5 to version 2.0.6:**\r\n\r\n- Fix eglplatform in header only build not correctly replacing the khrplatform include\r\n- Fix compile warning when GLAD_GLES2_USE_SYSTEM_EGL=1\r\n- Fix: Use include instead of find_package for CMake config\r\n- c: don't warn on undefined GLAD_GLES2_USE_SYSTEM_EGL\r\n\r\n**Changes from version 2.0.6 to version 2.0.7:**\r\n\r\n- Fix resource lookups without setuptools for most recent Python versions\r\n- Fix parsing of most recent Vulkan definitions\r\n- Fix compilation errors with strict flags on recent gcc versions\r\n- example: defines GLAD_GL_IMPLEMENTATION in GLFW example\r\n- ci: bump actions versions\r\n\r\n**Changes from version 2.0.7 to version 2.0.8:**\r\n\r\n- files: updates to latest specifications\r\n- rust: replace static mut references with addr_of\r\n- Replace setup.py with pyproject.toml\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs",